sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant TrainerOp as trainer-operator<br/>(controller-runtime)
    participant KFCtrl as kubeflow-trainer-controller-manager<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>(openshift-monitoring)
    participant User as Data Scientist

    rect rgb(220, 240, 255)
        Note over Admin,TrainerOp: Flow 1: Trainer CR Reconciliation
        Admin->>K8sAPI: Create Trainer CR (default-trainer)
        K8sAPI->>TrainerOp: Watch event<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS<br/>SA token auth
        TrainerOp->>TrainerOp: Check JobSet operator health
        TrainerOp->>TrainerOp: Copy manifests, apply RELATED_IMAGE overrides
        TrainerOp->>TrainerOp: Render kustomize overlays
        TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply (field-owner: trainer-module-controller)<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS<br/>SA token auth
        Note right of TrainerOp: Deploys: CRDs, RBAC, Deployment,<br/>Webhooks, ClusterTrainingRuntimes,<br/>ImageStreams, ServiceMonitor
        K8sAPI-->>TrainerOp: Apply result
        TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Update Trainer status/conditions
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 220)
        Note over User,KFCtrl: Flow 2: TrainJob Admission
        User->>K8sAPI: Create TrainJob CR
        K8sAPI->>KFCtrl: Mutating webhook<br/>POST /mutate-trainer-kubeflow-org-v1alpha1-trainjob<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS<br/>API server client cert
        KFCtrl-->>K8sAPI: Defaulted TrainJob
        K8sAPI->>KFCtrl: Validating webhook<br/>POST /validate-trainer-kubeflow-org-v1alpha1-trainjob<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS<br/>API server client cert
        KFCtrl-->>K8sAPI: Admission decision
        K8sAPI-->>User: TrainJob created
    end

    rect rgb(220, 255, 220)
        Note over Prom,KFCtrl: Flow 3: Metrics Scraping
        Prom->>KFCtrl: GET /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS (cluster profile)<br/>Bearer token (SA)
        KFCtrl->>KFCtrl: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
        KFCtrl-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
    end
